WEBVTT

00:00:11.166 --> 00:00:13.166
[lightsaber ignites]

00:00:22.833 --> 00:00:24.500
[blasters firing]

00:00:27.583 --> 00:00:29.750
[explosion]

00:00:29.833 --> 00:00:32.125
[panting]

00:00:36.750 --> 00:00:39.000
[screaming]

00:00:41.791 --> 00:00:43.500
[groaning]

00:00:44.833 --> 00:00:47.208
[guitar riff plays]

00:00:48.958 --> 00:00:52.083
-You! What are you?
-[yelps]

00:00:52.666 --> 00:00:55.250
[stammers] I'm…

00:00:56.250 --> 00:00:58.000
[rock music playing]

00:01:02.916 --> 00:01:06.083
♪ <i>You are okay!</i> ♪

00:01:06.166 --> 00:01:09.208
[rock music continues]

00:01:13.708 --> 00:01:17.458
Thank you so much!
We are your band, Star Waver!

00:01:17.541 --> 00:01:20.458
On flaming rumble bass, Gee!

00:01:21.708 --> 00:01:25.250
On the versatile cluster drums, Lan!

00:01:26.958 --> 00:01:30.250
On the electrified dual guitars, Kurti!

00:01:31.291 --> 00:01:32.958
And on vocals, it's me--

00:01:33.041 --> 00:01:34.958
[speaker feedback]

00:01:35.041 --> 00:01:37.500
-Oh, sorry. Sorry 'bout that, folks.
-[droid beeps]

00:01:38.208 --> 00:01:40.666
-And rocking those electronic sounds…
-[man] Hey, who are they?

00:01:40.750 --> 00:01:41.875
…it's V-5!

00:01:41.958 --> 00:01:43.541
And on vocals, it's me--

00:01:43.625 --> 00:01:45.125
[music stops]

00:01:45.208 --> 00:01:46.458
[crowd murmurs]

00:01:46.541 --> 00:01:47.791
Uh, hey, guys.

00:01:47.875 --> 00:01:49.958
We're sorta playing a gig here. [yelps]

00:01:51.291 --> 00:01:53.083
[Boba Fett]
I have business with this slug.

00:01:54.708 --> 00:01:57.166
Come along. Jabba's been looking for you.

00:01:57.833 --> 00:02:01.000
If you resist,
we'll disintegrate your friends.

00:02:02.333 --> 00:02:04.916
[laughs]

00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:07.750
Tell me, does Jabba want my autograph?

00:02:07.833 --> 00:02:09.750
[all groan]

00:02:09.833 --> 00:02:11.500
Let's rock 'em!

00:02:14.708 --> 00:02:16.875
[grunting]

00:02:19.458 --> 00:02:21.375
[grunting]

00:02:24.625 --> 00:02:25.833
-[grunts]
-[sighs]

00:02:25.916 --> 00:02:27.041
-[screaming]
-[grunting]

00:02:27.125 --> 00:02:29.541
[crowd screaming]

00:02:40.625 --> 00:02:41.833
Move out!

00:02:44.125 --> 00:02:45.625
Ha!

00:03:03.625 --> 00:03:05.291
This is the third time now.

00:03:05.375 --> 00:03:08.541
-[Kurti] Such passionate fans we have.
-Yep. That's just the price of fame.

00:03:08.625 --> 00:03:10.291
-[V-5 beeps]
-Hey!

00:03:11.500 --> 00:03:14.041
I know. We never finish the set.

00:03:14.125 --> 00:03:15.791
Well, we live to play another day.

00:03:15.875 --> 00:03:17.958
Yeah, I suppose you'd rather die
for your art.

00:03:18.041 --> 00:03:19.041
[boy] Guys, enough.

00:03:19.125 --> 00:03:22.541
It just--
Be nice to finish a show for once.

00:03:22.625 --> 00:03:24.583
[all sigh]

00:03:25.083 --> 00:03:26.916
-[loud clanging]
-[all gasp]

00:03:27.000 --> 00:03:28.041
We've been followed!

00:03:28.125 --> 00:03:29.500
Persistent, isn't he?

00:03:29.583 --> 00:03:31.041
Okay, punch it!

00:03:31.125 --> 00:03:32.708
[Kurti] I've punched it already!

00:03:36.875 --> 00:03:38.208
[V-5 beeping]

00:03:38.291 --> 00:03:39.291
[all] Shut up!

00:03:40.625 --> 00:03:41.750
[rumbling]

00:03:47.875 --> 00:03:49.416
I got a bad feeling about this.

00:03:50.291 --> 00:03:51.291
-[explosion]
-[grunts]

00:04:06.625 --> 00:04:09.125
-[grunting]
-[footsteps approaching]

00:04:11.000 --> 00:04:12.041
[yelps]

00:04:12.125 --> 00:04:14.083
You're marked for execution, Hutt.

00:04:14.166 --> 00:04:17.291
It's pointless to resist, but I can wait.

00:04:17.375 --> 00:04:19.166
I don't even know what I did.

00:04:19.250 --> 00:04:20.291
You know.

00:04:21.375 --> 00:04:23.083
I don't care about Hutt legacy.

00:04:23.875 --> 00:04:25.208
I won't join Jabba.

00:04:25.291 --> 00:04:27.166
Being a part of that syndicate is boring.

00:04:27.250 --> 00:04:28.666
We're going to be part
of a legendary band!

00:04:28.750 --> 00:04:29.916
Jabba is not to be crossed.

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:31.416
What? No, wait!

00:04:31.500 --> 00:04:32.666
[grumbles]

00:04:32.750 --> 00:04:33.833
[sighs]

00:04:33.916 --> 00:04:34.916
Okay.

00:04:37.041 --> 00:04:38.666
[footsteps approaching]

00:04:39.166 --> 00:04:40.166
Stop!

00:04:43.750 --> 00:04:45.916
You really want to do this?

00:04:49.750 --> 00:04:51.375
[boy] What? No…

00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:19.666
[V-5 beeps]

00:05:21.750 --> 00:05:23.833
-[clanking]
-[footsteps approaching]

00:05:24.750 --> 00:05:26.791
-Huh?
-Come on. Get up and help, Jay.

00:05:26.875 --> 00:05:28.416
You know how to fix things too.

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:31.416
Yeah, but Gee…

00:05:32.125 --> 00:05:33.791
[Kurti] There's nothing
we could have done.

00:05:33.875 --> 00:05:36.833
Perhaps we were just lucky
and our luck ran out.

00:05:36.916 --> 00:05:38.666
Ultimately, we are just a band.

00:05:40.000 --> 00:05:41.791
I know that!

00:05:41.875 --> 00:05:45.541
I know that. But I can't just abandon him.

00:05:45.625 --> 00:05:47.750
After all we've been through…

00:05:48.625 --> 00:05:50.500
[whimpers]

00:05:50.583 --> 00:05:53.458
You… What are you?

00:05:56.125 --> 00:05:57.625
[stammers] I'm…

00:05:59.083 --> 00:06:00.291
Huh?

00:06:09.583 --> 00:06:10.583
[radio static]

00:06:10.666 --> 00:06:13.541
[Gee on recording] <i>Testing, testing,</i>
<i>one, two, three, sibilance.</i>

00:06:13.625 --> 00:06:16.625
<i>We should commemorate</i>
<i>the first session of Star Waver.</i>

00:06:16.708 --> 00:06:19.041
-<i>Jay! Kurti! Lan!</i>
-[V-5 beeps]

00:06:19.125 --> 00:06:22.500
<i>Yeah, and you too, V-5.</i>
[laughs]<i> I'd never forget you.</i>

00:06:22.583 --> 00:06:25.416
<i>I've finally got the band members</i>
<i>I was looking for.</i>

00:06:25.500 --> 00:06:27.291
<i>Our legend starts here!</i>

00:06:27.833 --> 00:06:30.041
[Jay]<i> All right, all right,</i>
<i>let's get on with it, Gee.</i>

00:06:30.125 --> 00:06:32.000
[Gee]<i> Okay, yeah. Fine, fine, yeah.</i>

00:06:32.083 --> 00:06:33.916
<i>Lan, count it off!</i>

00:06:34.583 --> 00:06:36.791
[Lan] <i>One, two! One, two, three, four!</i>

00:06:36.875 --> 00:06:40.291
[music playing on speakers]

00:06:40.375 --> 00:06:44.083
The first time we played together.
We had a lot of fun that day.

00:06:44.166 --> 00:06:45.166
We did.

00:06:46.666 --> 00:06:47.833
[grunts]

00:06:52.250 --> 00:06:54.958
[screams]

00:06:55.041 --> 00:06:56.041
[Kurti] Jay?

00:06:56.750 --> 00:06:58.125
[Jay] You were right, Kurti.

00:06:59.125 --> 00:07:01.958
In the end, we're just a band.

00:07:03.500 --> 00:07:04.791
We're just a band.

00:07:34.208 --> 00:07:36.208
Huh? What-- What--

00:07:36.291 --> 00:07:37.375
[Jay] Hey, Gee.

00:07:37.458 --> 00:07:39.583
Wh-- You guys, what are you doing here?

00:07:39.666 --> 00:07:43.833
We made a deal with Jabba
to let us perform before he executes you.

00:07:43.916 --> 00:07:47.083
We only get one song though, so…

00:07:47.166 --> 00:07:50.208
Have you lost your minds?
You don't need to get caught up in this.

00:07:50.291 --> 00:07:53.083
You should go. You guys are just…

00:07:53.166 --> 00:07:55.500
[Kurti] You're not one to run away
from your fans, are you?

00:07:55.583 --> 00:07:58.416
This'll be our biggest venue
since we formed the band, Gee!

00:07:58.500 --> 00:07:59.750
[V-5 beeps]

00:07:59.833 --> 00:08:01.583
Let's make this our best show ever.

00:08:07.166 --> 00:08:08.833
[Gee] Let's rock!

00:08:25.083 --> 00:08:26.083
[Jabba groans]

00:08:27.541 --> 00:08:29.375
-[grunts]
-Huh?

00:08:30.041 --> 00:08:32.750
-Calm down. It's just a mic.
-[humming]

00:08:35.625 --> 00:08:39.458
One, two! One, two, three, four!

00:08:42.166 --> 00:08:44.750
♪ <i>Come on and lose yourself now</i>
<i>Everybody!</i> ♪

00:08:44.833 --> 00:08:47.208
♪ <i>Da-da-da dancing</i>
<i>Hey, we move your body</i> ♪

00:08:47.291 --> 00:08:50.041
♪ <i>We just be strumming</i>
<i>Telling ya we love it</i> ♪

00:08:50.125 --> 00:08:52.500
♪ <i>Da-da-da don't stop</i>
<i>Hey, we all about it</i> ♪

00:08:52.583 --> 00:08:55.500
♪ <i>You are okay!</i> ♪

00:08:55.583 --> 00:08:58.125
[crowd cheering]

00:09:12.000 --> 00:09:14.583
♪ <i>Can you hear us, everybody out there?</i> ♪

00:09:14.666 --> 00:09:17.208
♪ <i>Countless beings</i>
<i>Far across the cosmos</i> ♪

00:09:17.291 --> 00:09:19.833
♪ <i>Whether one</i>
<i>Or a hundred million parsecs</i> ♪

00:09:19.916 --> 00:09:23.166
♪ <i>You don't know us</i>
<i>But you are about to</i> ♪

00:09:23.250 --> 00:09:26.083
♪ <i>We'll break on through</i>
<i>The speed of light</i> ♪

00:09:26.166 --> 00:09:28.125
♪ <i>And sing to reach you</i> ♪

00:09:28.208 --> 00:09:33.125
♪ <i>And live our dreams right out</i> ♪

00:09:34.250 --> 00:09:37.166
♪ <i>Come on and shout it out!</i> ♪

00:09:39.041 --> 00:09:42.750
♪ <i>Don't care what side you're on</i> ♪

00:09:42.833 --> 00:09:47.916
♪ <i>No clue, where do we go from here?</i> ♪

00:09:48.000 --> 00:09:53.375
♪ <i>There'll be no more words</i>
<i>Only laughter!</i> ♪

00:09:53.458 --> 00:09:55.833
♪ <i>Come on and lose yourself now</i>
<i>Everybody!</i> ♪

00:09:55.916 --> 00:09:58.833
♪ <i>Da-da-da dancing</i>
<i>Hey, we move your body!</i> ♪

00:09:58.916 --> 00:10:01.208
♪ <i>We just be strumming</i>
<i>Telling ya we love it</i> ♪

00:10:01.291 --> 00:10:03.833
♪ <i>Da-da-da don't stop</i>
<i>Hey, we all about it</i> ♪

00:10:03.916 --> 00:10:06.541
♪ <i>Just lose yourself and sing now</i>
<i>Everybody</i> ♪

00:10:06.625 --> 00:10:09.166
♪ <i>Da-da-da dancing</i>
<i>Hey, we move your body</i> ♪

00:10:09.250 --> 00:10:11.833
♪ <i>We just be strumming</i>
<i>Telling ya we love it</i> ♪

00:10:11.916 --> 00:10:14.541
♪ <i>Da-da-da don't stop</i>
<i>Hey, we all about it</i> ♪

00:10:14.625 --> 00:10:17.833
♪ <i>You are okay!</i> ♪

00:10:17.916 --> 00:10:20.458
♪ <i>Hey, say! Be, be yourself!</i> ♪

00:10:20.541 --> 00:10:23.083
♪ <i>Hey, say! Free yourself, yeah!</i> ♪

00:10:23.166 --> 00:10:25.708
♪ <i>Hey, say! Be, be yourself!</i> ♪

00:10:25.791 --> 00:10:28.333
♪ <i>Hey, say! Free yourself, yeah!</i> ♪

00:10:28.416 --> 00:10:30.958
♪ <i>Hey, say! Be, be yourself!</i> ♪

00:10:31.041 --> 00:10:33.583
♪ <i>Hey, say! Free yourself, yeah!</i> ♪

00:10:33.666 --> 00:10:36.333
♪ <i>Hey, say! Be, be yourself!</i> ♪

00:10:36.416 --> 00:10:38.875
♪ <i>Hey, say! Free yourself, yeah!</i> ♪

00:10:40.000 --> 00:10:42.166
[crowd cheering]

00:10:46.500 --> 00:10:47.666
[crowd gasps]

00:10:48.958 --> 00:10:50.375
[crowd murmuring]

00:10:50.458 --> 00:10:51.625
[grunts]

00:10:52.291 --> 00:10:53.916
-Huh?
-Hey, Jabba!

00:10:54.708 --> 00:10:56.208
We'll give you a chance!

00:10:56.833 --> 00:10:59.833
We're going to be the number one band
in the galaxy.

00:10:59.916 --> 00:11:01.166
Hmm.

00:11:01.250 --> 00:11:04.666
So then, how do you feel
about becoming our first sponsor?

00:11:04.750 --> 00:11:06.416
[grumbles]

00:11:06.500 --> 00:11:10.416
[deep breathing]

00:11:10.500 --> 00:11:14.208
One more song! One more song!
One more song!

00:11:14.291 --> 00:11:15.916
-One more!
-Come on!

00:11:16.000 --> 00:11:18.250
-[crowd chattering]
-[man 1] One more!

00:11:19.833 --> 00:11:21.916
-[man 2] Come on, Jabba!
-[man 3] Let them sing!

00:11:22.000 --> 00:11:25.416
[crowd chattering continues, fades]

00:11:25.500 --> 00:11:28.000
-[Jay, Gee grunt]
-[blasters fire]

00:11:35.250 --> 00:11:37.666
[chuckles] Yeah! They did it!

00:11:37.750 --> 00:11:39.416
-[crowd cheering]
-[sighs]

00:11:39.500 --> 00:11:41.375
-[both chuckle]
-[rock music playing]

00:11:43.875 --> 00:11:46.541
[crowd cheering]

00:11:58.458 --> 00:12:00.375
-[rhythmic clapping]
-[crowd chanting]

00:12:03.458 --> 00:12:06.250
[speaks Huttese]

00:12:06.333 --> 00:12:07.791
[chuckles]

00:12:07.875 --> 00:12:10.083
[chanting, clapping continues]

00:12:15.833 --> 00:12:18.333
-[Jay] Okay then, you ready for one more?
-[crowd] Yeah!

00:12:18.416 --> 00:12:20.250
[Jay] This one's for the band!

00:12:20.333 --> 00:12:22.875
[rock music continues]
